-- A matrix from an entry function, the transpose and its determinant,
-- the column versions of the row laws of the determinant, and the
-- vanishing of a determinant with two equal rows or columns.
-- Part of the CAD blueprint.
-- Planned home: Algebra/Ring/DeterminantColumns.
